# Python payloads for the self-guided labs.
# Each maps to a level of the hermetic-complexity narrative:
cryptography   # Level 1 — Rust + OpenSSL extension; the build-time trap
pytesseract    # Level 2 — pure-Python wrapper that shells out to `tesseract`
Pillow         # Level 2 — build/open the image we OCR
pyopencl       # Level 3 — needs an OpenCL ICD at runtime (POCL on CPU)
numpy          # Level 3 — host buffers for the kernel
